# Put this file in ~/.serpentine3d/plugins/ and restart Serpentine3D.
# Commands:
#   attach    put an object on a face, measured from two of its edges, so it
#             follows when the face moves or turns
#   unattach  take an attachment away
#   and: a selected attached object shows its face, edges and distances
# Delete the file to remove them.
